{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "simulation Phase 2 (#841): sm.openfromms scenarios run by CASA and by casa-rs, in two stages",
  "notes": [
    "Each scenario observes, closes and reopens its MS with openfromms; the calls after openfromms rewrite its rows. An openfromms_ms of casa has casa-rs reopen a copy of CASA's first stage (<name>.stage1.ms), so only the later calls' DATA differs; otherwise casa-rs reopens its own.",
    "Model images are named relative to the oracle's --model-root, as in sm_predict_scenarios.json: alma/model4 is 256 pixels of 0.05 arcsec centred on 10h -30d with one plane per channel of the 4-channel 230 GHz band; alma-mosaic/model1 is that file's make_bench_model.py image.",
    "openfromms-mosaic-het-casa-ms reopens CASA's observed heterogeneous mosaic and predicts through the mosaic machine; CASA 6.7.6's close then aborts (close_aborts), as after any mosaic predict.",
    "CASA's VisSet adds MODEL_DATA and CORRECTED_DATA to an MS without them; casa-rs creates neither (plan decision 6) and keeps the ones there are in step with DATA, which its laws check (crates/casa-simulation/tests/open_from_ms.rs). CORRECTED_DATA is not compared here.",
    "The moved-pointing scenarios observe a second pointing of 'target' moved 10.4 arcsec east, which keeps target's FIELD row: CASA phases it on the field, and so does casa-rs, in its own session as after openfromms (#884). A point at the field predicts unit amplitude and zero phase in both pointings."
  ],
  "complists": {
    "point-at-field.cl": [
      {"flux": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0", "-30d00m00.0"], "shape": "point", "freq": "230GHz"}
    ],
    "shapes.cl": [
      {"flux": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.1540", "-30d00m00.0"], "shape": "point", "freq": "230GHz"},
      {"flux": [0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "09h59m59.7690", "-29d59m59.0"], "shape": "gaussian", "majoraxis": "1arcsec", "minoraxis": "0.5arcsec", "positionangle": "30deg", "freq": "230GHz", "spectrumtype": "spectral index", "index": -0.7},
      {"flux": [0.3, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "fluxunit": "Jy", "polarization": "Stokes", "dir": ["J2000", "10h00m00.0770", "-30d00m02.0"], "shape": "disk", "majoraxis": "2arcsec", "minoraxis": "1.5arcsec", "positionangle": "60deg", "freq": "230GHz"}
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
